<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Balli Kombëtar</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as National Front (Albania)</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Balli Kombëtar (<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/national-front-czechoslovakia">National Front</a>) was an Albanian nationalist and anti-communist organisation founded in 1939 by Midhat Frashëri to resist the Italian occupation. It sought an ethnic Albania including <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kosovo">Kosovo</a> and clashed with the communist-led Partisans. After the German occupation of 1943 some of its members collaborated with the Germans, and it was destroyed when the Partisans won the civil war in 1944.</p></div>
